this point.  If it is nil, limit to nearest \\section - like statement."
  (unless reftex-section-regexp (reftex-compile-variables))
  (catch 'exit
    (save-excursion
      (if (null which) (throw 'exit nil))
      (let ((bound (or bound (save-excursion (re-search-backward
