is non-nil, bury it and return nil; otherwise return t."
  (when (buffer-modified-p)
    (save-buffer))
  (if remember-notes-bury-on-kill
      (progn
        ;; bury-buffer always returns nil, but let's be explicit.
        (bury-buffer)
        nil)
    t))

