;; @~              ==>    ~         tilde accent

;;   These have braces, but take no argument:
;; @OE{}           ==>    OE        French-OE-ligature
;; @oe{}           ==>    oe
;; @AA{}           ==>    AA        Scandinavian-A-with-circle
