contain compiled expansions of the macros.  If you don't do so,
then the expanded macros do their job silently."
  :type '(choice (const :tag "Quiet, without catching errors" errors)
                 (const :tag "Quiet" nil)
                 (const :tag "Verbose" t)
                 (const :tag "Debug" debug))
  :group 'use-package
  :version "29.1")

