decompressors are available and handled by auto-compression mode,
e.g. \"\\\\.\\\\(g?z\\\\|bz2\\\\|xz\\\\)\\\\\\='\" for `gzip', `bzip2', or `xz'.
Should begin with \\. and end with \\\\=' and MUST NOT be optional."
